        I wrote my own Bun security scanner,
        <a
            href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@tihn/bun-guard"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
            @tihn/bun-guard
        </a>
        , powered by the osv.dev database, and I sometimes make silly placeholder sites like
        <a href="https://waga.gay" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">waga.gay</a>
